        "cooked": "<p>Speaking of Con...</p><p>While playing last night I took a look at <em>Con's Bunker.</em>&nbsp;Is it just me or is that the moon shattered in the background there? Did Baron Blade's Terralunar Impulsion Beam do some damage before it was shut down? (also, it's really close if that is the moon)</p>",
