      {
        "id": 87361,
        "name": "dlott1988",
        "username": "dlott1988",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dlott1988/{size}/2135_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-29T00:52:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Anyone else think Con might be Ambuscade?</p><p>He's a bounty hunter. He's known Haka awhile. F.I.L.T.E.R. could have forced him to become some sort of bulletin poster as punishment for his crimes. That could also explain his presence in Chrono-Ranger's deck.</p><p>As for the excitement at Chrono's arrival, that could be a symptom of centuries of loneliness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I admit this is just wild speculation. A better guess is probably Tachyon.</p>",
        "post_number": 75,
